<title>POLAND: Polish grain, livestock prices remain stable in May. [CORRECTED 14:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>Polish grain, livestock prices remain stable in May. [CORRECTED 14:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish rye and cattle prices fell, with livestock and milk prices remaining stable, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>(Corrects to show rye price did not rise but fell.)</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES		 MAY 97   APRIL 97  MAY 96</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  51.18     51.17    64.99</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	     0.0	-3.2     0.7</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		   -21.3     -20.8     78.7</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  40.13     40.88    39.28</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -2.8	 0.4	7.7</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    -1.8	12.1     67.1</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.49	2.51     2.55</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -0.7	-2.6     -2.2</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    -2.3	-3.7     18.8</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.59	3.59     2.68</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -0.1	 5.2	1.3</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    33.6	32.1	6.5</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.58	0.58     0.51</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -0.1	 0.4     -1.4</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    14.0	12.5     17.0</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
